      "text": "Add enough water in the pot to cover the beef. At this point put everything into the pot except the cauliflower and cover with a lid. If using a saucepan simmer the beef for 40 minutes, stirring occasionally. If you are using a pressure cooker, let the beef cook for 15 minutes (after the cooker begins to hiss)."
    },
